IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLTAUD.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "BKAUDP".
COPY "BKEVTP".
01 WS-AUD-ACT PIC X(12).

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "CLTP".
01 LS-ENTITY PIC X(12).
01 LS-ACTION PIC X(12).
01 LS-BEFORE PIC X(120).
01 LS-AFTER PIC X(120).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-CLT-PARMS LS-ENTITY LS-ACTION
    LS-BEFORE LS-AFTER.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-AUD-PARMS
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-AUD-ACT
    STRING "CLT." DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(LS-ACTION)
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-AUD-ACT
    END-STRING
    MOVE CP-OPERATOR TO BK-AUD-OPERATOR
    MOVE WS-AUD-ACT TO BK-AUD-ACTION
    MOVE LS-ENTITY TO BK-AUD-ENTITY
    MOVE CP-CORR TO BK-AUD-CORR
    MOVE LS-BEFORE TO BK-AUD-BEFORE
    MOVE LS-AFTER TO BK-AUD-AFTER
    MOVE CP-RC TO BK-AUD-RESULT
    CALL "BAUD" USING BK-AUD-PARMS
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-EVT-TYPE
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-EVT-PAYLOAD
    MOVE LS-ENTITY TO BK-EVT-KEY
    STRING "COLLATERAL." DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(LS-ACTION)
        DELIMITED SIZE ".v1" DELIMITED SIZE INTO BK-EVT-TYPE
    END-STRING
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(LS-BEFORE) DELIMITED SIZE "->" DELIMITED
        SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(LS-AFTER) DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO BK-EVT-PAYLOAD
    END-STRING
    CALL "BEVT" USING BK-EVT-PARMS
    GOBACK.
